I'm guessing you're not defining HACKDIR?  It should point to the
NetHack playground directory...



I have the following in my ~/.gdbinit:

define nhdebug
  set args -D
  set environment HACKDIR ./
  file nethack
  run
end

And then I can just use that command, for example with
 "gdb --eval-command=nhdebug"
when I'm in the NetHack playground dir.

